ODRL22.ttl is the ODRL 2.2 vocabulary (W3C Recommendation), downloaded from
https://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/ODRL22.ttl on 2026-10-10. due2 added only the
three-line comment at its top, which names the source; the rest is unmodified,
and was still identical to the source on 2026-10-19.

